@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: MVP core / cross-cutting. Core presentation/application/files or shared authority/recovery invariant remains applicable.
title Proposed file admission and actual accounting
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam shadowing false

participant "Authorized producer" as P
participant "Files handler" as F
database "Policy / quota / artifact records" as DB
participant "Private storage / processing adapter" as S
P -> F : intended growth + category + command identity
F -> F : current resource authority / input checks
F -> DB : atomic policy/usage guard + reservation
DB --> F : attributable admission result
alt admitted
 F -> S : bounded private candidate write / processing
 S --> F : actual size / validation / storage evidence
 F -> DB : finalize usable state + reconcile reserved/actual usage
 note over F,DB
 No false usable artifact or transient free-capacity gap.
 Interrupted effects remain attributable for reconciliation.
 end note
 F --> P : permitted confirmed / pending / failed outcome
else rejected or conflict
 F --> P : safe admission result; no usable artifact claim
end
@enduml
